 "headline_reads": [
  "CARE-BED EFFICIENCY: beds/100k x suicide r=-0.361 (n=50) \u2014 the only clean negative in the state cross-section; homicide side POSITIVE +0.448 (beds sit where violence sits \u2014 the cross-grain confound class, same as the NY county finding r=+0.286)",
  "SMHA-DOLLAR EFFICIENCY: SMHA$/capita x homicide ~ZERO +0.010 and x suicide -0.156 nonsig \u2014 replicates the rank-15 SMHA-spend-null class at the outcome margin: dollars alone do not price the outcome",
  "THE PER-DOLLAR TABLE: national SMHA $1.70M per psych bed; per-state the ratio fans from ~$0.1M-class to multi-million \u2014 Iowa+Vermont = high-spend/low-beds (rank-5 'funding-not-beds' corroborator in the wild), Oregon/NY = high-spend+high-beds",
  "CAGE-BED PER-DOLLAR: state jail-BENCH stock not keyless (BJS blocked) \u2014 the cage side ships as arrest-INTAKE proxy (CDE 2023, 51/51 real) + NY county bench anchor; intake x homicide +0.119 (intake-follows-crime reaction class)",
  "NY BENCH ANCHOR: latest jail-census/100k x certified-beds/100k r=+0.033 (n=57) \u2014 inside-NY the cross-section is FLAT, consistent with lane-4's verdict that NY's swap is pre-1997-complete; boarded-in-psych flow: 320 (1997) -> peak 541 (2005) -> 161 (2025), the direct care->cage bridge column banked for the next pass"
 ],
